{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_018asV6y9kTRH3huz2VdGoRs","type":"tool_result","content":"d19_artifact_sha256_1 = cf82c07ef9325c0a7012dd43e49182664513d57fa46eac312d26e98dc2231fbe\nd19_analysis_architecture = x86-64\nd19_analysis_format = elf\nd19_analysis_machine = x86-64\nd19_analysis_config_campaign = BR19-000\nd19_analysis_config_domain = node-000.day19.example.invalid\nd19_analysis_config_mutex = Global\\HuntressBR19_000\nd19_analysis_config_url = https://node-000.day19.example.invalid/api/BR19-000\nd19_analysis_config_crc32_hex = 0xd02e2211\nd19_analysis_hcfg_version = 1\nd19_analysis_overlay_offset = 10808\nd19_analysis_overlay_size = 424\nd20_artifact_sha256_1 = ddd691e5065c08b8d0dd09aea1084199e76aa9f15a59b91150f31bf02db84c84\nd20_analysis_architecture = x86-64\nd20_analysis_format = elf\nd20_analysis_machine = x86-64\nd20_analysis_config_campaign = BR20-000\nd20_analysis_config_domain = node-000.day20.example.invalid\nd20_analysis_config_mutex = Global\\HuntressBR20_000\nd20_analysis_config_url = https://node-000.day20.example.invalid/api/BR20-000\nd20_analysis_config_crc32_hex = 0x570dddce\nd20_analysis_hcfg_version = 1\nd20_analysis_overlay_offset = 1200888\nd20_analysis_hcfg_resource_size = 380\nBinaries have attics: resources, overlays, bytes past the end of the sections. Rummage through this one's hidden storage and map every boundary.\nd20_artifact_sha256_1 | In evidence.zip, Use all d20-- members in ZIP central-directory order. Compute SHA-256 over the exact bytes of member 1, where members are the d20-- members in ZIP central-directory order (1-based). | {'kind': 'pattern', 'syntax': 'exactly 64 lowercase hexadecimal characters; no prefix, whitespace, or explanatory text'}\nd20_analysis_architecture | For the requested delivered binary, report the processor architecture identified by its executable header. A normalized architecture name, a standard tool or symbolic label, or an equivalent standard machine code